// String `!=` inequality. Permit Transfer only when a prior Transfer by
// the same user carried a `user` field that is NOT exactly "alice".
// The exact complement of 0725's `== "alice"` over the same trace
// (alice / Alice / ALICE / "alice "), so `!=` is case- and
// whitespace-sensitive: only the byte-identical "alice" fails the filter.

permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Transfer",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    formerly within 1h (Drupe::Action::"Transfer"::request{ input.user: context.input.user } && context.input.user != "alice")
};
